# Override broad ~/.gitignore_global patterns ('*credential*', '*token*',
# '*secret*', etc.) for project source files. These globals are useful
# for keeping rogue .env-style files out of repos, but they also silently
# eat source modules whose names happen to contain those substrings.
# Re-include all source / test / data files in the project tree.
!clawmes/**/*.py
!clawmes/**/*.md
!clawmes/**/*.yaml
!clawmes/**/*.yml
!clawmes/**/*.json
!clawmes/**/*.txt
!clawmes/**/*.toml
!tests/**/*.py
!tests/**/*.md

